Package: marketconf
Type: Package
Title: Stock Market Confidence Indices from Yale School of Management
Date: 2026-10-14
Version: 1.0.2
Authors@R: person("Enrique", "Pérez Herrero",
    email = "eph.project1500@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Maintainer: Enrique Pérez Herrero <eph.project1500@gmail.com>
Description: Downloads the U.S. stock market confidence indices (One Year,
    Valuation, Buy-On-Dips and Crash) published monthly by the International
    Center for Finance at the Yale School of Management
    <https://som.yale.edu/centers/international-center-for-finance/data/stock-market-confidence-indices>.
    The indices are derived from survey data on the behavior of individual and
    institutional investors.
Depends: R (>= 3.4.1)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/EnriquePH/marketconf
BugReports: https://github.com/EnriquePH/marketconf/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    magrittr,
    dplyr,
    lubridate (>= 1.7.10)
Suggests: curl,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    ggplot2,
    testthat (>= 3.1.7)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
